.TH REVIEW 1 "July 2026" "Review 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
review \- view and edit PDF and image files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B review
.RI [ FILE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Review
is a native GNOME viewer and editor for PDF and raster image files.  It
supports page organization, PDF annotations, reusable visual signatures,
secure destructive cropping, and conversion of PDF pages to 300 DPI
full-color image-only pages.
.PP
Each file is opened in its own application window.  With no file argument,
Review opens a file chooser.
.SH OPTIONS
Standard GTK and GApplication options are accepted.  Use
.B review --help
to display the options supported by the installed build.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/review/signatures
Saved visual signatures.  The directory and its files are private to the
current user.  These are appearance stamps, not cryptographic signatures.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qpdf (1)
